{
  "rationale": "The plant is split into sensing and motion. The specification binds sensor outcomes to safe and efficient exploration actions, enforcing conservative obstacle recovery and steady coverage. Exploration alternates between random_walk and short forward pulses, with deterministic recovery for each obstacle type. Only one controllable is enabled per state, and all uncontrollables are total. Full_rotate is reserved for repeated or unrecoverable blockage.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for perception and motion to model open-loop actuation and asynchronous sensing.",
    "Specification automaton encodes safe, deterministic exploration: random_walk in clear, move_forward for short progress, and conservative turn/scan recovery for obstacles, always returning to exploration after path_clear."
  ],
